sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM/SGLang Pods
    participant Prom as Prometheus / Thanos Querier<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Collector as WVA Metrics Collector
    participant SatEngine as WVA Saturation Engine<br/>(V2 token/capacity)
    participant Optimizer as WVA Pipeline Optimizer
    participant Limiter as WVA GPU Limiter
    participant Cache as WVA Decision Cache
    participant Actuator as WVA Metrics Actuator<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant HPAKEDA as HPA / KEDA
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS mTLS
    participant Deploy as Deployment / LWS

    Note over vLLM,Deploy: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling Loop

    vLLM->>Prom: Expose KV cache, queue,<br/>throughput metrics (scraped)
    Collector->>Prom: PromQL query<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA)
    Prom-->>Collector: Per-replica metrics
    Collector->>SatEngine: Aggregated replica metrics
    SatEngine->>Optimizer: Raw desired replicas
    Optimizer->>Limiter: Check GPU availability
    Limiter-->>Optimizer: Constrained allocation
    Optimizer->>Cache: Optimal replica count
    Cache->>Actuator: Emit wva_desired_replicas
    Actuator->>Prom: Prometheus scrape (/metrics)
    HPAKEDA->>Prom: Query wva_desired_replicas<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Prom-->>HPAKEDA: Desired replica count
    HPAKEDA->>K8sAPI: PATCH scale subresource<br/>Auth: SA Token (mTLS)
    K8sAPI->>Deploy: Update replicas

    Note over vLLM,Deploy: Flow 2: Scale-From-Zero

    participant EPP as EPP (Endpoint Picker)
    participant SFZ as WVA Scale-From-Zero Engine<br/>(100ms polling)
    participant DirectAct as WVA Direct Actuator

    EPP->>Prom: Expose flow_control_queue_size (scraped)
    SFZ->>Prom: Query queue_size for zero-replica models<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Prom-->>SFZ: Pending request count
    SFZ->>DirectAct: Scale to 1 decision
    DirectAct->>K8sAPI: PATCH scale subresource<br/>Auth: SA Token (mTLS)
    K8sAPI->>Deploy: Set replicas = 1

    Note over vLLM,Deploy: Flow 3: ConfigMap-Driven Config Update

    participant User as User / GitOps
    participant CMR as WVA ConfigMap Reconciler

    User->>K8sAPI: Update ConfigMap<br/>(saturation-scaling / scale-to-zero)
    K8sAPI->>CMR: Informer notification
    CMR->>SatEngine: Update config (thread-safe)
